<title>NEW ZEALAND: Infratil sees another good year.</title>
<headline>Infratil sees another good year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infrastructure and Utilities NZ Ltd on Monday said it anticipated the current year would be &quot;another good one&quot;.</p>
<p>However, it warned that strong gains in its share price and net tangible asset backing in the year to March 31 were &quot;not necessarily sustainable at the same rate of increase&quot;.</p>
</text>
